abstract: >
  FwCC: FRB–w Cross-Correlation pipeline. 
  Measures angular cross-correlation between extragalactic FRB dispersion measures
  and galaxy overdensity maps without point redshift assignments. 
  Applied to CHIME/FRB Catalogue 2 and DESI DR1.

